      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Creating Runnable Components (Javascript)",
      "source_hash": 7292189661571156318,
      "context_hash": 13986004898853403718,
      "translation": "실행 가능한 컴포넌트 만들기 (Javascript)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:41.163320Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Exporting `wasi:cli/run` to create",
      "source_hash": 17855240009260393056,
      "context_hash": 17495763733433765853,
      "translation": "`wasi:cli/run`을 익스포트하여 생성하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:41.163320Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Components created with `jco` can export the `wasi:cli/run` interface, similarly to WebAssembly components written in other languages.",
      "source_hash": 6705976203865888777,
      "context_hash": 16197528513170459118,
      "translation": "`jco`로 생성한 컴포넌트는 다른 언어로 작성된 WebAssembly 컴포넌트와 마찬가지로 `wasi:cli/run` 인터페이스를 익스포트할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interface": "인터페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:41.163320Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Exporting the `wasi:cli/run` interfaces enables ecosystem tooling to interoperate with (and run) the component you've built (e.g. `wasmtime run`).",
      "source_hash": 2928739159106842966,
      "context_hash": 9738109518826995166,
      "translation": "`wasi:cli/run` 인터페이스를 익스포트하면 생태계 도구가 여러분이 빌드한 컴포넌트와 상호운용(및 실행)할 수 있습니다 (예: `wasmtime run`).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:41.163320Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Components that conform to `wasi:cli/run` can be very concise.",
      "source_hash": 854939530820673730,
      "context_hash": 7547424945176598251,
      "translation": "`wasi:cli/run`을 준수하는 컴포넌트는 매우 간결할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:41.163321Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "For example:",
      "source_hash": 4114854479619665730,
      "context_hash": 10402101618561716096,
      "translation": "예를 들면:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:41.163321Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The above component can be made recognizable as \"runnable\" to `wasi:cli`-aware tooling with the following WIT:",
      "source_hash": 4731495275373175218,
      "context_hash": 11044811403742595566,
      "translation": "위 컴포넌트는 다음 WIT를 통해 `wasi:cli`를 인식하는 도구에게 \"실행 가능한\" 것으로 인식되게 만들 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:41.163321Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}